<div class="greeting">Hello <%= name %>,</div>

<div class="message">
  Welcome to <strong>TechHealthCare</strong>! We're excited to have you on board.
  <br><br>
  To complete your registration, please verify your email address using the One-Time Password (OTP) below.
</div>

<div class="appointment-details">
  <div class="detail-title">Your Verification Code</div>
  <div style="
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-align: center;
    color: #0070f3;
    letter-spacing: 6px;
    margin: 20px 0;
  ">
    <%= otp %>
  </div>
  <p style="text-align:center; color:#64748b; font-size:14px;">
    This OTP is valid for <strong>10 minutes</strong>.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="instructions">
  <div class="instructions-title">Having trouble?</div>
  <ul class="instructions-list">
    <li>Make sure to use the OTP within the time limit.</li>
    <li>If you didn't request this, you can safely ignore this email.</li>
    <li>Do not share your OTP with anyone for security reasons.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="message">
  Thank you for choosing <strong>TechHealthCare</strong> — where technology meets trusted care.
</div>
